WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.405 --> 00:00:02.685
Close your eyes

00:00:05.495 --> 00:00:06.895
See with mind

00:00:11.005 --> 00:00:14.055
You are a top student, but look at you now

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:17.195
You can't keep using your father's disappearance as an excuse to act out

00:00:18.555 --> 00:00:19.685
Is that his work?

00:00:20.975 --> 00:00:22.200
What's is about?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.965
Her dad wanted to

00:00:23.965 --> 00:00:25.385
touch the stars

00:00:27.685 --> 00:00:29.335
Imagine that the

00:00:29.385 --> 00:00:32.165
ant here wants to get to her other hand

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.985
It's quickest option is to walk across the string

00:00:34.615 --> 00:00:36.395
But it turns out,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.760
a straight line is not the shortest distance between two points

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.740
Not if you use a fifth dimension

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.500
It's outside of the rules we know of time and space

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:52.280
So, the ant arrives in my hand instantaneously

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.520
So you fold space?

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.040
More like we wrinkle it.

00:00:59.095 --> 00:01:00.095
Where are we?

00:01:02.105 --> 00:01:04.615
We heard a cry out in the universe

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.220
My father's alive

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:08.560
We believe he is

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:10.240
and we're here to help you find him

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.800
We are in search of warriors

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.800
Warriors to serve the good and the light and the universe

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.180
You're kidding

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:20.740
Do I look like I'm kidding?

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.700
A little
I'm not

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:23.860
I'm not

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.880
Your father is trapped by evil energy

00:01:27.885 --> 00:01:29.680
It's too strong for our light

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.680
And the only one who can stop it

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Is you

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:34.500
Be a warrior

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.100
My love is always there

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:03.480
even if you can't see

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.640
Do you trust me?

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.000
I trust you

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:16.540
Meg

